    ["Inside ^The Construct Quarter^, stick to the left and follow the path around to reach ^Patchwerk^."] = "Dentro de ^The Construct Quarter^, mantente a la izquierda y sigue el camino hasta ^Patchwerk^.",
    ["Inside ^The Military Quarter^, follow the path to reach some stairs. Go down and cross the room to reach ^Instructor Razuvious^."] = "Dentro de ^The Military Quarter^, sigue el camino hasta unas escaleras. Baja y cruza la sala para llegar a ^Instructor Razuvious^.",
